  unitName: Glorious Shine Mora
  unitId: 51167
  unitNumber: 1606
  description: One theory holds that Mora is a direct descendant of the demons that
    sought to bring peaceful rule to Ishgria. Given that, some also speculate that
    her parents' failure may have influenced Mora's relentless scheming to seize
    power. Had Mora held more closely to her parents' ideals instead of focusing
    exclusively on power alone, she might have adopted more cautious and realistic
    methods in her quest. In doing so, she also might have succeeded in spreading
    the ideal of peaceful coexistence throughout Ishgria and in changing the nature
    of that land.
  summonDesc: A world where only the strong survive... I'm completely sick of the
    idea of worthless worlds like that.
  fusionDesc: What is your aim in granting me power? Never mind, I need to stop second-guessing.
    I'm just happy you like me.
  evoDesc: Their ideals weren't misguided.<br>Only their methods were wrong.<br>I
    will make their dream come true, no matter what.
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
